---
description: Repository structure rules for the Mango Tree agent platform.
globs: ["agents/**/*", "api/**/*", "utils/**/*", "config/**/*", "tests/**/*", "docs/**/*.md"]
alwaysApply: false
---

Runtime code belongs under `agents/`, `api/`, `utils/apps/`, and `utils/shared/`. Docs belong under `docs/`. Frontend code belongs under `web/`. Use `uv` for Python. Keep coordinator, planner, tools, memory, and providers separated under `agents/`. App domain logic belongs in `utils/apps/{name}/backend/services/`. Tests should include denied behavior for security boundaries.
